# Workspaces: steps from parity/shell_modules_menubar_Workspaces.qml.md (batches 1-5). Screen TESSERA-TEST 1920x1080 scale 1;
# the island is centred at x 960 (closed y ~14, open ~392 wide); the bar is 30 px tall.
# Each block runs in both looks: the file runs top to bottom, Material first, then Glass.

look material
note the space menu (right-click a chip, ~945,14) is checked by hand: the runner's pointer has no right button
setup python3 -c 'import json, os;p = os.path.expanduser("~/.config/tessera/config.json"); c = json.load(open(p)); m = c.setdefault("menubar", {}); m["workspaceOverflow"] = "dynamic"; m["workspaceCount"] = 3; json.dump(c, open(p, "w"), indent=4)'
wait 3
key -M alt -k 6 -m alt
wait 1
shot overflow
note chips past the window's ends are smaller in both directions and fainter
key -M alt -k 1 -m alt
wait 1
ptr glide 945 14 300
ptr scroll 0 -15
wait 0.6
shot wheel
note the wheel stepped to the next space

look glass
note the space menu (right-click a chip, ~945,14) is checked by hand: the runner's pointer has no right button
setup python3 -c 'import json, os;p = os.path.expanduser("~/.config/tessera/config.json"); c = json.load(open(p)); m = c.setdefault("menubar", {}); m["workspaceOverflow"] = "dynamic"; m["workspaceCount"] = 3; json.dump(c, open(p, "w"), indent=4)'
wait 3
key -M alt -k 6 -m alt
wait 1
shot overflow
note chips past the window's ends are smaller in both directions and fainter
key -M alt -k 1 -m alt
wait 1
ptr glide 945 14 300
ptr scroll 0 -15
wait 0.6
shot wheel
note the wheel stepped to the next space
